JubilifeCity_Condominium_2F_Text_NPC3_2:
	.string "I like making my Pokémon use their\n"
	.string "attacks.\p"
	.string "Sometimes, when they get stronger,\n"
	.string "they learn new moves.\p"
	.string "Those new moves keep things fresh and\n"
	.string "are a fun distraction for me!$"

JubilifeCity_Condominium_2F_Text_NPC1_2:
	.string "Did you buy some Heal Balls at the Poké\n"
	.string "Mart?\p"
	.string "A Heal Ball completely heals the\n"
	.string "Pokémon it captures on the spot.\p"
	.string "That means you can catch a Pokémon and\n"
	.string "have it battle-ready right away.\p"
	.string "Of course, if your team has six Pokémon\n"
	.string "in it, it won't do any good.$"
